{"id": 11, "ok": true, "cmd": "prop01", "ucas": "prop01 L(9) mod 3", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "prop01", "space": "L(9,1)", "p": 3, "stable_page": 3, "degrees": [{"degree": 0, "H": "Z", "pages": [{"page": 1, "in_ker": true, "content": "3", "not_in_im": true, "holds": true}, {"page": 2, "in_ker": true, "content": "3", "not_in_im": true, "holds": true}, {"page": 3, "in_ker": true, "content": "3", "not_in_im": true, "holds": true}]}, {"degree": 1, "H": "0", "pages": [{"page": 1, "in_ker": true, "content": "0", "not_in_im": true, "holds": true}, {"page": 2, "in_ker": true, "content": "0", "not_in_im": true, "holds": true}, {"page": 3, "in_ker": true, "content": "0", "not_in_im": true, "holds": true}]}, {"degree": 2, "H": "Z/9", "pages": [{"page": 1, "in_ker": true, "content": "0", "not_in_im": true, "holds": true}, {"page": 2, "in_ker": true, "content": "0", "not_in_im": true, "holds": true}, {"page": 3, "in_ker": true, "content": "0", "not_in_im": true, "holds": true}]}, {"degree": 3, "H": "Z", "pages": [{"page": 1, "in_ker": true, "content": "3", "not_in_im": true, "holds": true}, {"page": 2, "in_ker": true, "content": "3", "not_in_im": true, "holds": true}, {"page": 3, "in_ker": true, "content": "3", "not_in_im": true, "holds": true}]}], "holds": true}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "d o d = 0", "points": 28, "passed": true, "text": "d o d = 0: verified 28 times"}, {"kind": "d maps relations to relations", "points": 3, "passed": true, "text": "d maps relations to relations: verified 3 times"}, {"kind": "chain map commutes with d", "points": 8, "passed": true, "text": "chain map commutes with d: verified 8 times"}, {"kind": "induced map well defined", "points": 57, "passed": true, "text": "induced map well defined: verified 57 times"}, {"kind": "exact", "points": 60, "passed": true, "text": "exact: verified 60 times"}, {"kind": "short exact (degree)", "points": 4, "passed": true, "text": "short exact (degree): verified 4 times"}, {"kind": "snake lemma lift", "points": 3, "passed": true, "text": "snake lemma lift: verified 3 times"}, {"kind": "stable page: d = 0, next page equal", "points": 4, "passed": true, "text": "stable page: d = 0, next page equal: verified 4 times"}], "proof": {"kind": "exhaustive", "text": "checked for every degree and every page up to the stable one; later pages are isomorphic to it"}, "files": [], "text": "Proposition 0.1 on L(9,1) at p = 3: if a in H^n(X; Z) generates a Z summand, then abar = j_r(p^(r-1) a) is in ker d_r^n and not in im d_r^(n-1), for every r >= 1\n  stable from page 3: i_3 is injective in every degree, so k_3 = 0, d_r = 0 and E_r = E_3 for every r >= 3 (E_inf = E_3)\n  n = 0: H^0 = Z\n    r = 1: d_1 j_1 3^0 = 0 on H^0 [ok]; ker(H^0 -> E_1^0 / im d_1) has content 3 != 1 [ok]\n    r = 2: d_2 j_2 3^1 = 0 on H^0 [ok]; ker(H^0 -> E_2^0 / im d_2) has content 3 != 1 [ok]\n    r = 3: d_3 j_3 3^2 = 0 on H^0 [ok]; ker(H^0 -> E_3^0 / im d_3) has content 3 != 1 [ok]\n  n = 1: H^1 = 0 (no Z summand: nothing to prove; checked anyway)\n    r = 1: d_1 j_1 3^0 = 0 on H^1 [ok]; ker(H^1 -> E_1^1 / im d_1) has content 0 [vacuous]\n    r = 2: d_2 j_2 3^1 = 0 on H^1 [ok]; ker(H^1 -> E_2^1 / im d_2) has content 0 [vacuous]\n    r = 3: d_3 j_3 3^2 = 0 on H^1 [ok]; ker(H^1 -> E_3^1 / im d_3) has content 0 [vacuous]\n  n = 2: H^2 = Z/9 (no Z summand: nothing to prove; checked anyway)\n    r = 1: d_1 j_1 3^0 = 0 on H^2 [ok]; ker(H^2 -> E_1^2 / im d_1) has content 0 [vacuous]\n    r = 2: d_2 j_2 3^1 = 0 on H^2 [ok]; ker(H^2 -> E_2^2 / im d_2) has content 0 [vacuous]\n    r = 3: d_3 j_3 3^2 = 0 on H^2 [ok]; ker(H^2 -> E_3^2 / im d_3) has content 0 [vacuous]\n  n = 3: H^3 = Z\n    r = 1: d_1 j_1 3^0 = 0 on H^3 [ok]; ker(H^3 -> E_1^3 / im d_1) has content 3 != 1 [ok]\n    r = 2: d_2 j_2 3^1 = 0 on H^3 [ok]; ker(H^3 -> E_2^3 / im d_2) has content 3 != 1 [ok]\n    r = 3: d_3 j_3 3^2 = 0 on H^3 [ok]; ker(H^3 -> E_3^3 / im d_3) has content 3 != 1 [ok]\n  why this is complete: a generates a Z summand of H iff its class in H/T(H) is primitive; psi_r(a) = [j_r(p^(r-1) a)] in E_r^n / im d_r^(n-1) vanishes iff a is in K = ker psi_r, and the image of K in the free group H/T(H) contains a primitive vector iff the gcd of its coordinates (the content) is 1\n  r > 3: page 3 is stable (i_3 injective: k = 0, and i_3 is an isomorphism of exact couples onto page 4 with j_(r+1)(p^r a) = j_r(p^(r-1) a)), so every later page and every abar is the one at r = 3\n  holds for every n and every r >= 1\n  check: d o d = 0 (28), d maps relations to relations (3), chain map commutes with d (8), induced map well defined (57), exact (60), short exact (degree) (4), snake lemma lift (3), stable page: d = 0, next page equal (4)\n"}
